search updated?\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-lg border border-border/30 bg-card/50 p-5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"How often is the research updated?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"We update each study on its natural refresh cycle. State tax burden and property tax data refresh annually after new Census and Tax Foundation releases. Child Tax Credit and OBBBA-related research updates whenever Congress or the IRS issues new guidance. Tax refund statistics update quarterly during the filing season (January through April) and once after the season ends.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"Can I cite TheTaxCalc research in my own work?\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-lg border border-border/30 bg-card/50 p-5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Can I cite TheTaxCalc research in my own work?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Yes. We encourage journalists, researchers, financial advisors, and educators to cite our research. Each study includes a permanent URL, publication date, and last-updated date so your readers can verify the source. Please link to the original study rather than copying the data tables wholesale. If you need a higher-resolution chart or raw data export, contact us at hello@thetaxcalc.com.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"Where does your data come from?\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-lg border border-border/30 bg-card/50 p-5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Where does your data come from?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Every figure in our research comes from an official government source. Federal tax data is sourced from IRS publications (Rev. Proc. 2025-25, Pub. 15-T, Pub. 972) and the Social Security Administration. State tax data comes from each state's Department of Revenue. Demographic and income data comes from the U.S. Census Bureau. Cost of living data comes from the Bureau of Economic Analysis and the Council for Community and Economic Research. We publish the full methodology and source list at the bottom of every study.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"Is TheTaxCalc research free to access?\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-lg border border-border/30 bg-card/50 p-5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Is TheTaxCalc research free to access?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Yes. Every study, data table, and chart in our research hub is free to read, with no paywall, no sign-up, and no email requirement. We do not collect your contact information when you read our research. We believe tax data should be freely accessible to every American. If you find the research useful, we encourage you to share it with colleagues or link to it from your own writing.\\\"}]]}],\\\"$L2a\\\"]}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1c:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Related Calculators\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L10\\\",\\\"/paycheck-calculator\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/paycheck-calculator\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-lg border border-border/30 bg-card/50 p-4 hover:border-emerald-500/40 hover:bg-emerald-500/5 tran